<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH Q4 REAL GDP GROWTH 4.7 PCT, FY 96 +4.4 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH Q4 REAL GDP GROWTH 4.7 PCT, FY 96 +4.4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech fourth quarter gross domestic product (GDP) grew 4.7 percent in real terms in 1996 over the same period in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The CSU added that real GDP for the full year 1996 rose 4.4 percent, after a 4.8 percent growth in 1995.</p>
</text>
